imud-prometheus (1.6.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New http_enabled key gates the /metrics listener. The stock config
    ships the daemon enabled with the output off.
  * Fix: enabled = false no longer crash-loops under systemd (Type=notify)
    — the bridge signals readiness before exiting cleanly.

